<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1335529596"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1448704871"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="夏恋慕"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="kobasolo / 春茶"/><amll:meta key="album" value="夏恋慕"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:06.004"><div begin="00:12.332" end="04:07.504"><p begin="00:12.332" end="00:16.853" itunes:key="L240">君が好きって分かっちゃうの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明白了对你喜爱的心意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga su ki 't te wa ka 'c cha u na</span></p><p begin="00:17.350" end="00:21.242" itunes:key="L241">水色に溶けた空<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空溶化进水蓝色之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi zu i ro ni to ke ta so ra</span></p><p begin="00:22.798" end="00:27.678" itunes:key="L242">落ち着かない僕を知られたくない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想让你知道我悸动的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o chi tsu ka na i bo ku wo shi ra re ta ku na i</span></p><p begin="00:27.798" end="00:32.446" itunes:key="L243">少し後ろを歩く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">稍稍向后走去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi u shi ro wo a ru ku</span></p><p begin="00:33.165" end="00:38.613" itunes:key="L244">まだ夏の匂いが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夏日的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da na tsu no ni o i ga</span></p><p begin="00:38.822" end="00:46.115" itunes:key="L245">潤んだ瞳を歪めているんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将湿润眼瞳中的景色扭曲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ru n da hi to mi wo yu ga me te i ru n da</span></p><p begin="00:46.636" end="00:49.282" itunes:key="L246">君はふわり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的身影轻飘 若即若离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wa fu wa ri to do ki so u de to do ka na i ke re do</span></p><p begin="00:49.440" end="00:57.853" itunes:key="L247">届きそうで届かないけれど</p><p begin="01:00.081" end="01:05.513" itunes:key="L248">ゆらりゆらり揺れる水面に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飘然摇曳的水面上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra ri yu ra ri yu re ru mi na mo ni</span></p><p begin="01:05.523" end="01:11.556" itunes:key="L249">僕は君の隣でいいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要我能在你身边便好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa ki mi no to na ri de i i no</span></p><p begin="01:11.566" end="01:16.577" itunes:key="L250">きらり光る空　眼差しで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忽而光芒闪烁的那眼神</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ra ri hi ka ru so no ma na za shi de</span></p><p begin="01:16.587" end="01:21.090" itunes:key="L251">夏色に心は踊る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的心雀跃不已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu i ro ni ko ko ro wa o do ru</span></p><p begin="01:21.969" end="01:26.869" itunes:key="L252">溢れそうな恋が染まる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">易碎的恋情染上夏天的色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo re so u na ko i ga so ma ru</span></p><p begin="01:35.885" end="01:40.321" itunes:key="L253">君に好きって言えないな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法对你表白爱意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni su ki 't te i e na i na</span></p><p begin="01:40.781" end="01:45.086" itunes:key="L254">気づきは滲んでまだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">景色一点点晕染模糊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke shi ki wa ni ji n de ma ta</span></p><p begin="01:46.285" end="01:51.232" itunes:key="L255">君のことを思い出にしたくない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想让你成为回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to wo o mo i de ni shi ta ku na i</span></p><p begin="01:51.397" end="01:56.043" itunes:key="L256">青く夏が暮れて行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">青葱的夏季就要结束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o ku na tsu ga ku re te i ku</span></p><p begin="01:56.748" end="02:02.363" itunes:key="L257">まだあの鈴の音が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个铃声再次响起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da a no su zu no ne ga</span></p><p begin="02:02.506" end="02:09.703" itunes:key="L258">浮かんだ僕を揺らしてるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让心绪漂浮的我动摇不已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ka n da bo ku wo yu ra shi te i ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:10.182" end="02:13.129" itunes:key="L259">君が笑う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你嫣然微笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga wa ra u</span></p><p begin="02:13.247" end="02:21.174" itunes:key="L260">それだけで良かったはずなのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅是如此便十分美好 然而</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re da ke de yo ka 't ta ha zu na no ni</span></p><p begin="02:23.648" end="02:29.072" itunes:key="L261">ぽたりぽたり　ともる夏の日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雨声嘀嗒淋透了夏日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po ta ri po ta ri to o ru na tsu no hi</span></p><p begin="02:29.082" end="02:35.086" itunes:key="L262">僕は君に恋していいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要我恋慕着你便好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa ki mi ni ko i shi te i i no</span></p><p begin="02:35.096" end="02:39.948" itunes:key="L263">闇に溶ける花火みたいに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同溶于黑暗的烟火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya mi ni to ke ru ha na bi mi ta i ni</span></p><p begin="02:40.225" end="02:44.744" itunes:key="L264">君を前に心が覗く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心悄悄窥探置于眼前的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo ma e ni ko ko ro ga no zo ku</span></p><p begin="02:45.561" end="02:50.556" itunes:key="L265">ふらりふらり　君に揺れる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻轻地触碰你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ra ri fu ra ri ki mi ni fu re ru</span></p><p begin="02:54.051" end="03:04.791" itunes:key="L266">もっと隣で茜色が波に染まる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身边荡起无数红色的涟漪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to to na ri de a ka ne i ro ga na mi ni so ma ru</span></p><p begin="03:04.900" end="03:10.173" itunes:key="L267">そっと教えてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄悄告诉我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to o shi e te yo</span></p><p begin="03:10.284" end="03:14.963" itunes:key="L268">壊れないように優しく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不破坏任何事物 温柔地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa re na i yo u ni ya sa shi ku</span></p><p begin="03:15.318" end="03:26.187" itunes:key="L269">君と僕だけの思い出がくるり泳ぐ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在只属于你和我的记忆中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to bo ku da ke no o mo i de ga</span></p><p begin="03:28.731" end="03:33.249" itunes:key="L270">くるり泳ぐ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来回畅游</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ru ri o yo gu</span></p><p begin="03:35.330" end="03:40.523" itunes:key="L271">ゆらりゆらり揺れる水面に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飘然摇曳的水面上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra ri yu ra ri yu re ru mi na mo ni</span></p><p begin="03:40.643" end="03:46.472" itunes:key="L272">僕は君の隣で　いいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要我能在你身边便好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa ki mi no to na ri de i i no</span></p><p begin="03:46.602" end="03:51.463" itunes:key="L273">きらり光る空　眼差しで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忽而光芒闪烁的那眼神</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra ri hi ka ru so no ma na za shi de</span></p><p begin="03:51.700" end="03:56.356" itunes:key="L274">夏色に心は踊る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我的心雀跃不已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu i ro ni ko ko ro wa o do ru</span></p><p begin="03:57.048" end="04:01.682" itunes:key="L275">青のように儚いような<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如泡沫一般缥缈梦幻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a wa no yo u ni ha ka na i yo u na</span></p><p begin="04:02.425" end="04:07.504" itunes:key="L276">溢れそうな恋は染まる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">易碎的恋情染上夏天的色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo re so u na ko i wa so ma ru</span></p></div></body></tt>